---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy policy" description="How Virgil Digital handles enquiries and personal data.">
  <span class="kicker">Privacy</span>
  <h1>Privacy <span class="accent">policy.</span></h1>
  <p class="lede">A plain-English summary of what happens when you contact Virgil Digital.</p>
  <h2>Information you provide</h2>
  <p>If you use the enquiry form, I receive the name, email address, business details and message you choose to send. I use this information only to respond to your enquiry, discuss a project and provide the requested service.</p>
  <h2>Website analytics</h2>
  <p>This site uses Google Analytics to understand broad usage, such as which pages are visited. Analytics may use cookies or similar technologies. You can block cookies in your browser settings.</p>
  <h2>Third-party services</h2>
  <p>Enquiries are sent through Web3Forms. Google Analytics and Cloudflare may process technical information required to operate and measure the site. Their own privacy policies also apply.</p>
  <h2>Retention and your rights</h2>
  <p>I keep enquiry information only as long as reasonably needed to handle the conversation or provide the service. You can ask what personal information I hold, request correction or deletion, or object to its use by emailing <a href="mailto:hello@virgildigital.co.uk">hello@virgildigital.co.uk</a>.</p>
  <p><small>Last updated: 23 October 2026. This is general information, not legal advice.</small></p>
</Layout>
